<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
    <title>{{ blocked ? 'Conta bloqueada' : 'Aguardando aprovação' }} | TDR Admin</title>
    <link href="/assets/styles/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@500;700;900&family=Rajdhani:wght@500;600;700&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/styles/styles-admin.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>.login-body{min-height:100vh}</style>
</head>
<body class="login-body">
    <div class="login-box">
        <img src="/img/admin/logo.png" alt="">
        <h1>TDR<span>//</span>ADMIN</h1>
        {% if blocked %}
            <p class="login-sub">conta bloqueada</p>
            <p>A conta <b>{{ account.name|default('') }}</b> está bloqueada. Fale com o suporte para reativá-la.</p>
        {% else %}
            <p class="login-sub">aguardando aprovação</p>
            <p>Recebemos o cadastro de <b>{{ account.name }}</b>. Assim que o administrador aprovar, o painel fica disponível neste mesmo acesso (usuário <b>{{ username }}</b>).</p>
        {% endif %}
        <a class="btn" href="/admin/logout">Sair</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
